  dcterms:license <https://www.mit.edu/~amini/LICENSE.md>;
  dcterms:description """This FAIR Data Point provides structured metadata for the FAIRified Global Rivers dataset, developed as part of FAIR Data Engineering course. It contains a catalogue, dataset metadata, and an RDF distribution describing 1,387 river entries. The metadata includes persistent identifiers, provenance information, semantic representations, and references to the underlying data and documentation.

The FAIRified dataset is available in RDF format through a public GitHub repository and resolvable W3ID identifiers. The FAIR Data Point itself is deployed locally and provides a metadata interface following the FAIR Data Point architecture.""";
